[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0199","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0199.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0224","title":"SCO UnixWare ARCserver 本地符号链接漏洞","description":"SCO UnixWare 7.1 及 7.1.1 版本中的 ARCserver 组件在处理 /tmp 临时文件时存在符号链接漏洞。本地攻击者可通过创建恶意符号链接指向系统关键文件，当 ARCserver 以 root 权限写入临时文件时，将覆盖或篡改目标文件，从而实现权限提升获取 root 控制权限。该漏洞利用条件为拥有本地访问权限，攻击复杂度低。","severity":"LOW","score":1.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0224"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-15T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:15Z","remediation":"移除 ARCserve agent 的 setuid/setgid 权限位以防止本地提权；限制系统仅授权可信用户登录。由于 SCO UnixWare 7.x 已停止技术支持且无官方补丁，建议迁移至现代受支持的操作系统与备份解决方案（如 Amanda、Bacula）作为彻底修复措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&date=2000-02-15&msg=000101bf78af%2494528870%244d2f45a1%40jmagdych.na.nai.com","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19752","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/837e8232e5e0f859088f714711fc711909aefe8c/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0224.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0224","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0224.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8575b52c5f0d68ec89781aae82e849b4f469cd84/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0224.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-88qx-39r7-wq45/GHSA-88qx-39r7-wq45.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88294/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0224.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--5a4dcab7-6803-401a-8eb5-0506de4c5125.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0199.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0199.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0199.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0147","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0147.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0167","title":"Microsoft IIS 4.0 Pickup 目录拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 4.0 的 Pickup 目录存在拒绝服务漏洞，本地攻击者通过在该目录下创建文件名超长且扩展名为 .txt.eml 的邮件文件，可触发 Inetinfo.exe 进程崩溃，导致 IIS 邮件服务不可用。该漏洞影响 IIS 4.0 版本，利用条件为攻击者需具备本地文件写入权限，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低，属于本地拒绝服务漏洞。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0167"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-15T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:08Z","remediation":"该漏洞影响已停止支持的 Microsoft IIS 4.0（Windows NT 4.0 Option Pack），微软未发布针对此版本的安全更新。建议升级至 Windows Server 2003 及以上版本的 IIS 6.0 或更高版本；如无法升级，可通过 NTFS 权限限制本地用户对 %SystemRoot%\\System32\\Inetsrv\\mailroot\\Pickup 目录的写入权限，并启用文件名字长检查作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.ntbugtraq.com/default.asp?pid=36&sid=1&A2=ind0002&L=ntbugtraq&F=&S=&P=8800","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20310","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9b149e946381b5dfe67f5c76cee65997e05f3a01/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0167.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0167","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0167.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b8e6f3ed799539d1c038cf82ae94c10d35c39858/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0167.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gmg7-xp25-93hp/GHSA-gmg7-xp25-93hp.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/invicti/vulnerabilities/db/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/0xxx/cve-2000-0167.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0167.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--26d80389-5595-4b40-929f-5170b708523e.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001168.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0147.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0174","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0174.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0197","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 计划任务权限提升漏洞","description":"Windows NT 的计划任务调度器（Task Scheduler）在执行批处理文件时，会使用当前登录交互用户的驱动器映射而非系统账户的映射，导致本地低权限用户可通过将恶意批处理文件替换原始计划任务中的批处理文件，诱使系统以更高权限执行恶意代码，从而获取权限提升。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 4.0 系统，攻击者须具备本地登录权限，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0197"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-14T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:12Z","remediation":"立即安装 Windows NT 4.0 Service Pack 6a（最高版本服务包），该补丁已修复任务计划程序使用交互用户驱动器映射的问题。由于 Windows NT 4.0 已停止支持，建议升级至受支持的 Windows Server 版本（如 Windows Server 2019/2022）。临时缓解措施：限制可执行 AT 命令的用户权限，仅授权管理员账户使用计划任务功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/current/0202.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1050","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0197.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0197","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0197.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/09ea4c6e198f67c97f9e843f2fc9dbea00a9ec98/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0197.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-987q-p2gc-f52w/GHSA-987q-p2gc-f52w.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0197.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/80642f827c3cd89c2fb8893d0e3fe04ead516ea4/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0174.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0134","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0134.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0150","title":"Check Point Firewall-1 FTP 端口访问限制绕过漏洞","description":"Check Point Firewall-1 存在安全绕过漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 FTP 服务器发送恶意构造的数据包，诱使服务器返回被 Firewall-1 误判为合法的 227 响应（用于 PASV 被动模式端口协商），从而绕过防火墙的端口访问限制策略，实现对受保护内部网络的非授权访问。该漏洞影响 Check Point Firewall-1 系列产品，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击者可在无需认证的情况下远程利用，建议升级至厂商修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0150"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:06Z","remediation":"升级 Check Point Firewall-1 至 4.1 SP2 或 NG FP1 及以上版本（厂商已于 2000 年 2 月发布修复补丁）。如无法立即升级，可临时禁用防火墙的 FTP 应用层状态检测功能，或限制来自非信任网络的匿名 FTP 访问，同时确保 FTP 服务器不回显用户输入的命令参数到控制通道响应中。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/328867","http://www.osvdb.org/4417","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/979","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6acfb9cecc7e37f5bf14164f693abec3417aeb06/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0150.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0150","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0150.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df56f4cca3ff4a807de70444fbb8d3458b1d46ca/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0150.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-pjp8-g7wh-3846/GHSA-pjp8-g7wh-3846.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0150.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--e6b37487-b863-4fe6-a16d-f14a8db9b7b8.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001166.txt","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idbypass"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0134.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0408","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0408.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0141","title":"Infopop Ultimate Bulletin Board 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Infopop Ultimate Bulletin Board（UBB）论坛系统中存在命令注入漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可在发表主题时通过隐藏字段（topic hidden field）注入shell元字符，成功利用可导致服务器端任意命令执行，完全控制目标系统。该漏洞影响UBB全版本，CVSS评分10.0，危害等级严重。建议立即升级至不受影响版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0141"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:05Z","remediation":"升级至 Ultimate Bulletin Board 5.14 或更高版本，该版本已对 topic 隐藏表单字段进行 shell 元字符过滤。手动缓解措施：编辑 UBB CGI 脚本，在将所有用户输入（尤其是 topic 字段）传递给 system/popen 等调用之前，过滤掉 | ; ` $ ( ) 等 shell 特殊字符。UBB 已于 2000 年代停止维护，建议迁移至现代活跃维护的论坛系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/991","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&date=2000-02-22&msg=NDBBLKOPOLNKELHPDEFKIEPGCAAA.renzo.toma%40veronica.nl","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&date=2000-02-8&msg=20000211224935.A13236%40infomag.ape.relarn.ru","http://www.ultimatebb.com/home/versions.shtml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fe843ab2b4a415ff4c1b33508a5c7bbbe8d1116c/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0141.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0141","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2000/CVE-2000-0141/README.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0141.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be9b320c2a949cb73c32157503bdf6fad99f369e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0141.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g2jv-69ph-8q7w/GHSA-g2jv-69ph-8q7w.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664