2-08T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:06Z","remediation":"升级 Zeus Web Server 至 4.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复空字符截断问题。如无法升级，在 Web 服务器前端部署反向代理（如 Nginx），添加规则拦截包含 `%00` 的 URL 请求：`if ($request_uri ~* \"%00\") { return 403; }`。同时确保 Web 应用目录权限配置为禁止直接访问 CGI 脚本源码。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-02/0057.html","http://www.osvdb.org/254","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/977","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3982","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19747","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6acfb9cecc7e37f5bf14164f693abec3417aeb06/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0149.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0149","https://github.com/sullo/nikto/blob/999670cb6a939b6c93840ce666941756e4c5dcf5/program/databases/db_server_msgs","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0149.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df56f4cca3ff4a807de70444fbb8d3458b1d46ca/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0149.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/zeus.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2x73-fgvq-332r/GHSA-2x73-fgvq-332r.json","https://github.com/chushuai/wscan/blob/d154617a1da7302d292d7c3cce9dce39d85ddb0c/data/db_server.xml","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0133.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0132","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0132.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0147","title":"SCO OpenServer SNMPD 默认写入权限漏洞","description":"SCO OpenServer 操作系统中的 SNMPD 守护进程默认配置存在安全隐患，其 SNMP 团体字符串（community string）被设置为可写权限，导致本地攻击者可通过该默认团体字符串连接到目标系统的 SNMP 服务，进而修改系统 SNMP 配置信息。该漏洞影响 SCO OpenServer 多个版本，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级较低，攻击者需具备本地访问权限才能利用此漏洞。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0147"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-08T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:05Z","remediation":"建议立即从 SCO 官方 FTP 获取并安装安全公告 SB-00.04a 对应的补丁。作为临时缓解措施，编辑 /etc/snmpd.conf，将默认 SNMP community 字符串从 writable 改为 read-only，并在防火墙层面限制对 UDP 161 端口的访问，仅允许受信管理主机连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-02/0045.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/973","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f655f864c18bd25e1fca21f5741c644854233bf0/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0147.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0147","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0147.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be9b320c2a949cb73c32157503bdf6fad99f369e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0147.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/54ab2d6e8edcc52192915a067c45b2190f568993/references/CVE-2000-0147-2023-09-21-1730","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-rj5j-5wh3-4g3p/GHSA-rj5j-5wh3-4g3p.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/973/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0147.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001159.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0132.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0190","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0190.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0215","title":"SCO UnixWare 7.x cu 程序本地权限提升漏洞","description":"SCO UnixWare 7.x 系统中的 cu 程序存在安全漏洞，本地用户可利用该程序的特权缺陷获取系统高级权限，导致机密性、完整性和可用性完全丧失。攻击者需拥有本地访问权限，无需认证即可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0215"],"sources":["cve","avd"],"published":"2000-02-08T00:00:00Z","updated":"2024-11-20T00:00:00Z","remediation":"建议升级到 SCO 官方发布的安全补丁版本，限制 cu 程序的 suid 权限，或迁移至受支持的操作系统版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T06:45:47Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1019"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0190.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0131","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0131.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0146","title":"Novell GroupWise 5.5 Web Access Enhancement Pack Java Server 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Novell GroupWise 5.5 Enhancement Pack 的 Web Access 组件中的 Java Servlet 存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需认证，只需向目标服务器的 Servlet 发送超长 URI 请求，即可触发该漏洞，导致 Java 服务进程耗尽资源或崩溃，从而使 GroupWise Web 邮件服务不可用。该漏洞利用门槛低，攻击者仅需发送特制 HTTP 请求即可实施 DoS 攻击，影响范围包括 GroupWise 5.5 Enhancement Pack 版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0146"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-07T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:05Z","remediation":"升级到 Novell GroupWise 6.0 或更高版本，该问题已在后续版本中修复。若无法升级，可在前端 Web 服务器（如 Apache、IIS）中限制请求 URI 长度不超过 1024 字节，以阻止超长 URL 到达后端 Java Servlet 引擎。同时可在 servlet 容器层（如 Tomcat/JRun）配置 maxHttpHeaderSize 参数，对请求行长度进行服务端限制，缓解因畸形超长 URI 导致的拒绝服务攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-02/0049.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/972","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19744","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f655f864c18bd25e1fca21f5741c644854233bf0/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0146.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0146","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0146.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be9b320c2a949cb73c32157503bdf6fad99f369e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0146.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5p6w-4v4r-prx9/GHSA-5p6w-4v4r-prx9.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0146.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/3e910c6d0fff2c3163dd69b92eb626a214df8855/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0131.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0131.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0131.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0129","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0129.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0144","title":"Axis 700 Network Scanner 安全绕过漏洞","description":"Axis 700 Network Scanner 网络文档扫描服务器存在安全绕过漏洞，其管理员 URL 的访问权限未正确限制，远程攻击者可通过在 URL 路径中构造 `..`（点点）目录遍历序列绕过密码认证机制，从而未经授权访问设备管理界面及敏感配置信息。该漏洞影响 Axis 700 网络文档服务器设备，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0144"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-07T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:05Z","remediation":"升级 Axis 700 Network Scanner 固件至最新版本（Axis 在漏洞报告后发布了修复固件），通过设备 Web 管理界面或 Axis 官方 FTP 获取更新。如无法升级，在防火墙或路由器上限制仅允许受信任 IP 访问设备管理端口（默认 80/443），禁用公网直接访问，并将设备隔离在管理 VLAN 中。Web 管理界面中开启 IP 访问控制列表功能，仅允许管理员 IP 段访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-02/0034.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/971","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f655f864c18bd25e1fca21f5741c644854233bf0/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0144.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0144","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0144.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be9b320c2a949cb73c32157503bdf6fad99f369e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0144.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rm8x-hfrp-p324/GHSA-rm8x-hfrp-p324.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f913380f-c4b0-4874-8411-4b8b44f1c83c.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001157.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0144.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0129.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0395","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0395.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0472","title":"ISC innd 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"tags as requested.<value>ISC innd 2.x 版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。innd 是一个新闻传输 daemon 服务，处理新闻文章和广播。该漏洞源于 cancel 请求处理代码未对输入的 message ID 进行充分验证，当攻击者发送包含超长 message ID 的取消请求时，会导致缓冲区溢出，使控制流跳转到攻击者控制的代码地址。由于 innd 默认以 root 或高权限用户运行此服务，攻击者可通过网络远程触发此漏洞，获得完全控制权。攻击只需构造一个包含足够长度 malicious payload 的消息 ID 并发送 cancel 请求即可，攻击者无需身份验证即可利用此漏洞执行任意命令。","severity":"LOW","score":3.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0472"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-06T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:48Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 ISC INN (InterNetNews) 到 2.2.3 或更高版本（如 2.3.0+），该版本修复了 innd 2.2.2 中的 cancel 报文缓冲区溢出漏洞。若无法立即升级，建议在防火墙层面限制 NNTP 服务（默认端口 119）仅对可信 IP 开放，或在 innd.conf 中设置严格的 access/access.deny 访问控制列表限制 cancel 命令来源 IP。同时建议监控 NNTP 日志中的异常长 Message-ID 取消请求作为临时监测手段。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0003.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0097.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0298.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0330.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1316","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4615","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19998","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2191d577d2d643f301487a89dd6359b1113a07b9/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0472.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0472","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0472.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/80dda50d8d5f7811125252929942fe793daf4c0a/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0472.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/292f77a8e015ead047ef178a4e7ea4de6f3945c3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-3w6h-rmvf-r37v/GHSA-3w6h-rmvf-r37v.json","https://github.com/NetBSD/pkgsrc-wip/blob/d238d5bce44b90604ce028c0619c664802195051/sara/PLIST","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0472.md","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/innd_overflow.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0395.toml"}]